{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "891803f5f7adc05c",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "事件",
   "x": 8,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 419
  },
  {
   "id": "15b656be28fbb5d6",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "傭兵為何出現？",
   "x": 3612,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 407
  },
  {
   "id": "9590a700eb3a40e9",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "南極考察造假事件",
   "x": 1004,
   "y": 46,
   "width": 2584,
   "height": 955
  },
  {
   "id": "b503d9bb1f55ecce",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "化石是什麼？",
   "x": 1312,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 610
  },
  {
   "id": "83a056d93f512c5f",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "奧德斯是誰？",
   "x": 2308,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 861
  },
  {
   "id": "6eca50fefd90742f",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "廢棄研究所發生了什麼？",
   "x": 4276,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 1304,
   "height": 622
  },
  {
   "id": "a19268416bb74cc2",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "張睿案背景",
   "x": 5604,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 658
  },
  {
   "id": "54446d7342cadeac",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "日誌內容誰清楚？",
   "x": 3596,
   "y": 606,
   "width": 308,
   "height": 574
  },
  {
   "id": "f728a344dcb8e070",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "遠古生物及文明研究所",
   "x": 6600,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 180
  },
  {
   "id": "7207534e6bf735ea",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**張睿**\n\n天城博敏大學同事",
   "x": 364,
   "y": 638,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#16A34A"
  },
  {
   "id": "30da1308ea29eefd",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**化石下落不明**\n\n化石被盜後下落不明",
   "x": 696,
   "y": 399,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "ba788e752d27468a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**張睿轉私人機構**\n\n事件平息後離職，之後轉至私人研究機構，五年前回到大學任職",
   "x": 364,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "00b7319ded062a31",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**張睿帶走文件**\n\n張睿離職時暗中帶走有關廢棄研究所的文件調查",
   "x": 364,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "b79c221ad88c3037",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "實驗參與者轉移文件",
   "x": 32,
   "y": 184,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "2cb1c8c85bd09e32",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "廢棄研究所重新啟用",
   "x": 32,
   "y": 423,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "342f48ffa2edbd00",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "找回文件",
   "x": 696,
   "y": 184,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "d5b95e56fbe3b6da",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**VPTS識別章**\n\n屍體有VPTS的識別章",
   "x": 3636,
   "y": 160,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "87cbe4d5d0346424",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**未見VPTS活動**\n\n事前沒有發現VPTS在附近活動的跡象",
   "x": 3968,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "764e90743a3d3204",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**長期監視研究所**\n\n長期監視著研究所周邊活動",
   "x": 3802,
   "y": 399,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "ae1e14055e5968cd",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**斯普魯恩斯盜化石**\n\n斯普魯恩斯為保密盜去化石並用媒體炒作為學術詐騙",
   "x": 1028,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "eee031707216c1ac",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**神殿石板**\n\n神殿附近有一塊內容未解明的石板",
   "x": 3304,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "75c6fc4c65dc056e",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**人頭鳥身**\n\n人頭鳥身，高約30CM",
   "x": 1336,
   "y": 399,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "679f775aca783c26",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**神殿外發現**\n\n發現於南極一處山洞的神殿外",
   "x": 1514,
   "y": 160,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "2783c5af1fe4c17b",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**生活年代**\n\n生活於八十至一百萬年前",
   "x": 2000,
   "y": 160,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "b36df3b2e115f40c",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**化石確屬海之住民**\n\n考察所得化石確屬海之住民",
   "x": 1668,
   "y": 399,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "a77f9f00b221368b",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**基質稀薄期大滅絕**\n\n基質稀薄期，海之住民大滅絕",
   "x": 2000,
   "y": 399,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "d92d1e1da8641f13",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "已滅絕的海之住民\n\n`採信`",
   "x": 1668,
   "y": 662,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "15f785eefd86aae9",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**奧德斯**\n\n奧德斯．法哈利",
   "x": 2830,
   "y": 638,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#16A34A"
  },
  {
   "id": "b2b725d7d6abcb72",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**妻子彭達拉薩**\n\n妻子是彭達拉薩人，祖上是深海之星成員",
   "x": 2332,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "6fbc3e379722064a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**天城聯繫彭達拉薩**\n\n透過深海之星聯繫上其他彭達拉薩成員",
   "x": 2332,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "6ad30e5a5d8f75a1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**資料已失效**\n\n資料十年未更新，聯繫方式已失效",
   "x": 2664,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "2eb7171c3a79b416",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**奧德斯欺騙**\n\n奧德斯欺騙天城博敏其女之病無法治療",
   "x": 2996,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "128b46d0355ed13f",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "法哈利為彭達拉薩人",
   "x": 2830,
   "y": 901,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "996e15550776740d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**彈殼碎片**\n\n有彈殼、榴彈碎片",
   "x": 4300,
   "y": 160,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "4058d6df9b3741fe",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**屍體衣著**\n\n至少有研究員、保全、外來人員三種",
   "x": 4632,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "984f784028745547",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "地點極為偏僻",
   "x": 4632,
   "y": 184,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "e23d0fe1b861c941",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**與外界隔絕**\n\n研究所與外界幾近隔絕，所有人起居飲食全在研究所內",
   "x": 4964,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "e260651af2d2327e",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "曾發生激烈戰鬥",
   "x": 4300,
   "y": 423,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "dda54e22555a1e1a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "不只是帶走研究資料",
   "x": 4466,
   "y": 662,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "c296eed19c3d557e",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "從事生物研究",
   "x": 5296,
   "y": 184,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "8c9c8efc1f32fe46",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**多人死傷無人知**\n\n發生多人死傷也無人發現",
   "x": 4964,
   "y": 399,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "92660f24ad026355",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**同一研究所**\n\n天城博敏、張睿曾在同一研究所工作",
   "x": 5628,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "b53f8b0b4224f702",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**研究所治療**\n\n天城博敏曾帶天城美嘉留前往研究所治療",
   "x": 5960,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "0f857268cea0423c",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**天城博敏二次失蹤**\n\n天城博敏本答應完成收尾工作就回家，但再次失去聯絡",
   "x": 5794,
   "y": 626,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "fd9492892ec84f46",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**南極考察與化石**\n\n研究可能與阿奎斯托、化石有關",
   "x": 6126,
   "y": 638,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "bb4e1a3483a0638c",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**澤井引薦**\n\n澤井陽基是天城博敏的引薦人",
   "x": 5628,
   "y": 399,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#16A34A"
  },
  {
   "id": "0ad35a5408bc1d18",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**女兒先天疾病**\n\n女兒天城美嘉留患有先天性疾病",
   "x": 5960,
   "y": 160,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "3af5095846ff14cd",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**美嘉留記憶**\n\n美嘉留記憶中父親帶自己去治療的地方",
   "x": 6292,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "7f52cdb9fa1ceb86",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**澤井顧問**\n\n天城博敏找來的古代語顧問，協助破譯航海日誌",
   "x": 3620,
   "y": 865,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#16A34A"
  },
  {
   "id": "7bdfae259f30fc4d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**澤井失聯**\n\n考察後失聯",
   "x": 3620,
   "y": 638,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "6a82c00ada58d745",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "最清楚日誌內容",
   "x": 3620,
   "y": 1104,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "78f22bcc6feef227",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**研究古代文明**\n\n研究古代生物存在文明的可能性",
   "x": 6624,
   "y": 160,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "e89439d80f6b0bab",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**放任研究**\n\n放任遠古生物及文明研究所進行研究",
   "x": 6956,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "f0653510e86e62fc",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**深海之星支持**\n\n深海之星支持研究所運作",
   "x": 7288,
   "y": 160,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  }
 ],
